 client IP. Requests read stored data without starting upstream collection. Check status, stale, dates and coverage; HTTP 200 does not guarantee complete or current data. An attribution link is required by the terms of use."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kostnadsfritt elpris-API från Elpriser Sverige för dagens och morgondagens spotpriser i alla svenska elområden: SE1, SE2, SE3 och SE4. Hämta elpriser per kvart eller timme i JSON eller CSV, utan API-nyckel. Morgondagens priser visas först när de har publicerats av källan. Tillgänglig elprishistorik ingår, liksom kompletterande elsystemdata i JSON om bland annat produktion, elbehov och handel. Högst 30 anrop per minut och klientadress. API-anrop läser sparat underlag och startar ingen källhämtning. Kontrollera status, stale, datum och täckning; HTTP 200 garanterar inte komplett eller aktuellt underlag. Tillbakalänk krävs enligt användningsvillkoren."}],"dct:format":"application/json","dct:license":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#villkor"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#utgivare"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"API for today’s and tomorrow’s electricity prices in Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elpris-API för dagens och morgondagens elpriser i Sverige"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/kontakt"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-fcr","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#kontakt"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#distribution-fcr-json"},"dcat:keyword":["RVSMR AB",{"@language":"sv","@value":"FCR"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"balansmarknad"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#elsystem"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UPDATE_CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/openapi.json"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Latest stored ENTSO-E procurement decisions, exposed under SE3 according to the source’s Swedish reporting. Reserved MW and price per MW per delivery period in the source currency. No verified FCR-N/FCR-D split. Not energy, spot prices or promised household revenue."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Senast sparade separata upphandlingsbeslut från ENTSO-E, redovisade under SE3 enligt källans svenska rapportering. Reserverad effekt i MW och pris per MW och leveransperiod i källans valuta. Ingen verifierad uppdelning i FCR-N/FCR-D. Inte energi, spotpris eller utlovad hushållsintäkt."}],"dct:identifier":"elprisersverige:fcr","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-06"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#utgivare"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://transparency.entsoe.eu/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9a34028db77a8abbca98d342f51170b6467b5e12092506f275071c666510beac_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#period-fcr"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Contracted frequency containment reserves"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Upphandlade frekvenshållningsreserver"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/kontakt"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#api-v1"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#distribution-fcr-json","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#api-v1"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#elsystem"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Data via the documented API. Select a bidding zone; price queries also accept dates. Check status, freshness and coverage."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Underlag via API enligt dokumentationen. Välj elområde; prisfrågor kan också avgränsas med datum. Kontrollera status, aktualitet och täckning."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#villkor"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Contracted frequency containment reserves – JSON"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Upphandlade frekvenshållningsreserver – JSON"}],"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#kontakt","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Elpriser Sverige – RVSMR AB","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#kontaktadress"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:lukas@fjong.io"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/kontakt"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#utgivare","@type":["foaf:Agent","foaf:Organization"],"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Publisher of Elpriser Sverige."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utgivare av Elpriser Sverige."}],"dct:identifier":"559071-9547","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/Company"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"RVSMR AB"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/kontakt"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9a34028db77a8abbca98d342f51170b6467b5e12092506f275071c666510beac"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9d67b89e911cc813386bb46b5939026f2750e5795706fd3109cb51e9c65a2dc1_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((10.5935025 55.1370957, 24.1776850 55.1370957, 24.1776850 69.0599735, 10.5935025 69.0599735, 10.5935025 55.1370957))"},"dcat:centroid":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POINT(15 62)"},"dct:source":[{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2661886/"},{"@id":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/52822"}]},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/openapi.json","@type":"dct:Standard","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"OpenAPI-beskrivning av API-anrop, parametrar, svar och fel."},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elpriser Sveriges API-kontrakt v1"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#api-v1","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#kontakt"},"dcat:endpointDescription":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/openapi.json"},"dcat:endpointURL":[{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/prices"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/system"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"electricity prices"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"elpriser"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api"},"dcat:servesDataset":[{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-balance"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-elpriser"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-exchanges"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-fcr"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-forecasts"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-grid"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-load-outlook"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-production"},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-units"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/openapi.json"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Free electricity price API from Elpriser Sverige for today’s and tomorrow’s spot prices in all Swedish bidding zones: SE1, SE2, SE3 and SE4. Retrieve quarter-hour or hourly electricity prices as JSON or CSV without an API key. Tomorrow’s prices are shown after publication by the source. Available historical prices and additional power system data in JSON, including generation, load and trade, are also provided. Limit: 30 requests per minute per client IP. Requests read stored data without starting upstream collection. Check status, stale, dates and coverage; HTTP 200 does not guarantee complete or current data. An attribution link is required by the terms of use."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kostnadsfritt elpris-API från Elpriser Sverige för dagens och morgondagens spotpriser i alla svenska elområden: SE1, SE2, SE3 och SE4. Hämta elpriser per kvart eller timme i JSON eller CSV, utan API-nyckel. Morgondagens priser visas först när de har publicerats av källan. Tillgänglig elprishistorik ingår, liksom kompletterande elsystemdata i JSON om bland annat produktion, elbehov och handel. Högst 30 anrop per minut och klientadress. API-anrop läser sparat underlag och startar ingen källhämtning. Kontrollera status, stale, datum och täckning; HTTP 200 garanterar inte komplett eller aktuellt underlag. Tillbakalänk krävs enligt användningsvillkoren."}],"dct:format":"application/json","dct:license":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#villkor"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#utgivare"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"API for today’s and tomorrow’s electricity prices in Sweden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elpris-API för dagens och morgondagens elpriser i Sverige"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/kontakt"}},{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#dataset-production","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#kontakt"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#distribution-production-json"},"dcat:keyword":["RVSMR AB",{"@language":"sv","@value":"elförbrukning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"elproduktion"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api#elsystem"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENER"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UPDATE_CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/api/v1/openapi.json"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Latest stored regional generation and load from ENTSO-E. Time steps use unix_seconds, production types use production_types and values are MW. Null means missing; a trailing null marks the exclusive end. Check date, status, stale and coverage."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Senast sparad regional produktion och elbehov från ENTSO-E. Tidssteg anges med unix_seconds och kraftslag med production_types; värden är MW. Null är saknat värde och avslutande null markerar exklusivt slut. Kontrollera datum, status, stale och täckning."}],"dct:identifier":"elprisersverige:production","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-06"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#utgivare"},"dct:source":{"@id":"https://transparency.entsoe.eu/"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:9d67b89e911cc813386bb46b5939026f2750e5795706fd3109cb51e9c65a2dc1_b0n0"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"https://elprisersverige.nu/dcat-ap-se.rdf#period-production"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Regional electricity generation and load"},{"@la